{"id": "Dfem91cxcOh", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Jis mitti se Dada ne saari umar matke banaye, aaj usi mitti se Chutki ne apna pehla diya banaya 🪔\n\nRamdeen Dada ne bachpan mein banjar zameen se mitti khodi, aur saari umar usi chaak pe matke, kulhad aur diye banaye.\nPhir gaon shehar ban gaya, aur log matke chhod ke plastic ki baaltiyan le gaye.\nEk din use apni banayi hui mitti ki gudiya dikhi: tooti hui, jhuki hui, bilkul usi ki tarah.\nUs shaam Chutki unki laathi le aayi, puraani khaan se mitti bhari, chaak pe ek tedha sa diya banaya, Dada ke maathe pe mitti ka tilak lagaya, aur Dada hans pade.\n\n🎵 Maati · @bhaktaaa @akshatjakhar @farakmaybe @ansh4sure @mcsquare7000 \nSend this to the one who learnt something from their Dada’s hands 🤍\n\nMaati | Bhaktaaa | MC Square | Hustle 5 | kumhar | potter | chaak | mitti | Dada aur poti\n\n#Maati #Hustle5 #Kumhar", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1794136004, "like_count": 4859, "comment_count": 11, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2121335308475714a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.991, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPXXOoab2CiB_U14P5tka5gV52I0_eU0me1Qx9-sLepMa51DGtaXTozRCbqLtojEb5c2bVwSd0boOYVCwM3cP24yuv3kdl57Jhvogs.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqUSoLxdqGbAhHSpSkyMtvAR8wZlDdt0o4jTaQER3QRFyZD_bBNI8ZQIETAYM1MRdIU6l1R_KemEq9CzC76dzyy&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=mp-Sw7fkUwQQ7kNvwHu-NLV&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=is0DNIw8zcKVpERlh-nYIw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQR9pVwbqdMiEqQhX3O_azGLag8UqrhDnkpJfpqF9g1ePQ&oe=6AF45061", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 70.991, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Age